  "All protocols and specifications on this site are versioned research drafts (currently v0.1). They are not official standards, have not been adopted by any standards body, and may change without notice.": "Woke amaphrothokholo neenkcazelo kule sayidi mmadrafu wocwaningo anamaveshini (khathesi yi-v0.1). Akusizo iimgomo ezisemthethweni, akhange athathwe sikhungo namunye seemgomo, begodu angatjhugulula ngaphandle kwesaziso.",
  "All specs": "Zoke iinkcazelo",
  "Allowed": "Kuvunyelwe",
  "An experiment in AI/agent governance: this site is itself a working example": "Isilingo sokulawulwa kwe-AI/ejenti: le sayidi ngokwayo sibonelo esisebenzako",
  "Answer \"may AI learn from this?\" with dimension-level precision instead of a crawl bit.": "Phendula umbuzo othi \"ngabe i-AI ingafunda kilokhu na?\" ngokunemba kwezinga lomlinganiso kunokusebenzisa ibhithi le-crawl.",
  "Anthropic’s interpretability team identified internal \"emotion vectors\" in Claude Sonnet 4.5 that activate in contextually appropriate situations and causally shape behavior — for instance, amplifying a \"desperate\" vector increased blackmail-like responses, while boosting \"calm\" reduced them. The team stresses this shows functional, behavior-shaping emotion states, not evidence of subjective feeling.": "Iqembu lokuhlathulula le-Anthropic lifumene “iivekhitho zomuzwa” zangaphakathi ku-Claude Sonnet 4.5 ezivuselelwako eendaweni ezifaneleko ngokwesimo begodu zibumba ukuziphatha ngendlela yesizathu — ngokwesibonelo, ukukhulisa ivekhitho ye-“ukudinwa okukhulu” kwandisa iimpendulo ezifana nokuhlukumeza ngokusabisa, ngesikhathi ukukhulisa ye-“ukuthula” kuzehlise. Iqembu ligandelela bona lokhu kutjengisa iimo zomuzwa ezisebenzako ezibumba ukuziphatha, ingasi ubufakazi bomuzwa wangaphakathi.",
  "Architecting Trust in Artificial Epistemic Agents": "Architecting Trust in Artificial Epistemic Agents",
  "Argues that ontology — once dismissed as impractical — has become load-bearing infrastructure for AI reliability: large language model hallucination exposed a missing layer of \"meaning,\" and pragmatic, embedded ontologies now function as guardrails that anchor probabilistic output to accountable action.": "Iphakamisa bona i-ontology — le beyithathwa njengengekho phrakthikhali — isibe sisisekelo esithwala ubudisi bokuthenjwa kwe-AI: ukuhlanyazela kwamamodeli welimi amakhulu kuveze umqinga olahlekileko “wencazelo”, kanye ne-ontology esebenzako, efakwe ngaphakathi, isebenza njengeengqophamlilo ezibopha umphumela wamathuba esenzweni okuzokuthathwa umthwalo ngaso.",
  "Artificial Intelligence and Legal Personhood: Ethical, Regulatory, and Accountability Challenges in Contemporary Jurisprudence": "Artificial Intelligence and Legal Personhood: Ethical, Regulatory, and Accountability Challenges in Contemporary Jurisprudence",
  "Artificial Persons": "Abantu Abenziwako",
  "At the UN’s inaugural Global Dialogue on AI Governance in Geneva, Secretary-General António Guterres called for coordinated worldwide rules covering everything from child-safety obligations on AI developers to limits on unsafe autonomous weapons, warning that unchecked AI could deepen inequality between rich and poor nations.": "Kwi-Global Dialogue on AI Governance yokuthoma ye-UN eGeneva, uNobhala-Jikelele uAntónio Guterres ubize imithetho ehlanganisiweko yephasi mazombe ehlanganisa koke kusukela eembophweni zokuvikelwa kwabantwana kubathuthukisi be-AI kuya emikhawulweni yeenhlomo ezizenzelako ezinobungozi, esiyelelisa bona i-AI engalawulwa ingatjhidelanisa ukungalingani hlangana namazwe anothileko namampofu.",
