  "Code examples, JSON Schemas, and machine-readable policy templates are licensed under the MIT License unless otherwise stated. You may deploy them on your own sites freely.": "Iimbonelo zekhowudi, ii-JSON Schema, kanye neetemplate zomthetho ezifundeka yimitjhini zinelayisensi ye-MIT ngaphandle kobana kutjhiwo tjhini. Ungazibeka emahlangothini akho ngokukhululekileko.",
