  "Convert rights declarations into a workable licensing market instead of a binary open/closed web.": "Guqula iinzaziso zamalungelo zibe yimakethe yelayisensi esebenzako kunokuba newebhu ye-binary evulekileko/evaliweko.",
  "Copied ✓": "Kukopishiwe ✓",
