  "Correct positioning: independent research drafts, protocol proposals, and an open specification experiment.": "Ubunjalo obulungileko: amadrafu wocwaningo azimeleko, iinqophiso zamaphrothokholo, kanye nesilingo semininingwane evulekileko.",
  "Corrected an earlier default: Belgium (BE) now maps to Dutch instead of French — Flemish speakers are the country’s majority (~60%) over Walloon French speakers (~40%).": "Kulungiswe okwakuqale khwatjhi: iBelgium (BE) khathesi ihlanganiswa nesiDatjhi kunokuba nesiFrentji — abakhulumi besiFlemish bayinengi elizweni (~60%) kunabakhulumi besiFrentji sesiWaloni (~40%).",
  "Corrected an earlier default: Kazakhstan (KZ) now maps to Kazakh instead of Russian, now that a Kazakh translation exists — the same kind of fix as the earlier Belgium correction.": "Kulungiswe okwakuqale khwatjhi: iKazakhstan (KZ) khathesi ihlanganiswa nesiKazakh kunokuba nesiRashiya, njengombana khathesi kunehunyutjho lesiKazakh — luhlobo olufanako lokulungiswa okwenziwa kilo ekulungisweni kweBelgium ngaphambili.",
  "Could AI Be Conscious?": "Could AI Be Conscious?",
