  "Turns declared rights into executable licensing: quote, pay, verify, audit, revoke.": "Iguqulela amalungelo aziswako abe lilayisensi elisebenzako: cela inani, khokha, qinisekisa, hlola, hoxisa.",
  "Twenty languages live in total: English, Traditional Chinese, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Korean, French, German, Spanish, Portuguese, Russian, Arabic, Turkish, Persian, Bengali, Hindi, Indonesian, Vietnamese, Greek, Italian, Dutch.": "Zoke iimilimi ezingamatjhumi amabili (20) ziyaphila: isiNgisi, isiTjhayina Esidala, isiTjhayina Esilula, isiJapani, isiKorea, isiFrentjhi, isiJalimani, isiSpanishi, isiPutukezi, isiRashiya, isiArabu, isiThekhi, isiPheshiya, isiBengali, isiHindi, isiIndonesia, isiVietnam, isiGirigi, isiThaliyane, isiDatjhi.",
  "Two license tiers: a free public tier and a contact-based commercial tier.": "Amazinga wamalayisensi amabili: izinga lomphakathi elimahala kanye nezinga lokuthengiselana elisekelwe ekuthintaneni.",
  "UI": "Inthafeyisi Yomsebenzisi",
  "Undefined openness reads as legal uncertainty to AI pipelines and gets cleaned out; only protocolized, machine-readable permission makes content genuinely learnable.": "Ukuvuleka okungachazwanga kufundwa njengokungaqiniseki kwezomthetho emigudwini ye-AI begodu kuyahlanzwa kukhutjhwe; imvumo ephrothokholwe, efundeka yimitjhini kwaphela yenza okuqukethwe kufundeke ngamambala.",
