  "Verified dataset markets and collective licensing": "Amamakethe Wemikhoqo Yedatha Eqinisekisiweko Kanye Nelayisensi Yokuhlanganyela",
  "Verified in both LTR and RTL contexts: the panel mirrors correctly for Arabic and Persian without any special-casing, using logical CSS positioning.": "Kuqinisekisiwe eendaweni zombili, i-LTR ne-RTL: ipaneli izibonakalisa kuhle ye-isiArabu ne-isiPheshiya ngaphandle kwendaba ekhethekileko, isebenzisa isikhundla se-logical CSS.",
  "Verify": "Qinisekisa",
  "Version history of this site and its protocol drafts.": "Umlando Weeveshini Zale Sayidi Namadrafu Wayo Wamaphrothokholo.",
  "Version history of this site and its protocol drafts. Breaking spec changes are recorded here.": "Umlando weeveshini zale sayidi namadrafu wayo wamaphrothokholo. Iintjhugululo ezephulako zemininingwane zibhalwa lapha.",
  "Versioned specifications, JSON Schemas, and the policy files actually deployed on this site. Every file can be downloaded, validated, and cited directly.": "Imininingwane enamaveshini, ii-JSON Schema, kanye namafayela womthetho abekwe ngamambala kule sayidi. Ifayela ngalinye lingalayishwa, liqinisekiswe, begodu licaphunwe ngokuqondileko.",
  "Versioning": "Ukubekwa Amaveshini",
  "Versions": "Iiveshini",
  "Video and audio companions to the protocols and papers — the AI rights layer, watchable and listenable.": "Ividiyo Nomsindo Okuhambelana Namaphrothokholo Namaphepha — Umqinga Wamalungelo We-AI, Ongabukwa Nongalalelwa.",
  "Videos": "Iividiyo",
  "Want to generate your own policy file?": "Ufuna ukwenza ifayela lakho lomthetho?",
  "Web fonts are loaded from Google Fonts, which receives standard font requests from your browser. No other third-party scripts are used.": "Amafonti wewebhu alayishwa ku-Google Fonts, ethola iimcelo ezijwayelekileko zamafonti kusuka ku-browser yakho. Akukho amanye amasikripthi wabantu bangaphandle asetjenziswako.",
  "What AI systems may do with content: read, summarize, transform, retrieve, train, commercialize, redistribute. The AICR ruleset and the AICL licensing layer make these rights declarable and transactable.": "Lokho amasistimu we-AI angakwenza ngokuqukethwe: ukufunda, ukufingqa, ukuguqula, ukulanda, ukuqeqeshwa, ukuthengiselana, ukwabelwa kabusha. Isethi yemithetho ye-AICR kanye nomqinga welayisensi ye-AICL benza la malungelo aziswe begodu enziwe imisebenzana ngawo.",
  "What a server can return when an AI crawler requests licensed content without a license token — a machine-actionable quote instead of a dead end.": "Lokho isayeva engakubuyisela nasi-crawler ye-AI icela okuqukethwe okunelayisensi ngaphandle kwetokheni yelayisensi — inani elingasetjenziswa yimitjhini kunokuba kube mgudu ovaliweko.",
  "What this site is": "Bona Le Sayidi Iyini",
  "What this site is not": "Bona Le Sayidi Ayisiyo Yini",
  "When The Machines Deserve Our Consideration": "When The Machines Deserve Our Consideration",
  "Whether AI may learn, to what depth, for which purposes, and under what obligations. Being read is not being learned from; \"not prohibited\" is not \"learnable\". AIRS and AILP turn learning permission into a graduated, machine-readable spectrum.": "Ukobana i-AI ingafunda na, kubunjinini bani, ngeenhloso bani, kanye nangaphasi kwaziphi iimbophi. Ukufundwa akusikho ukufundwa kizo; “ukungavinjelwe” akusikho “okungafundwa”. I-AIRS ne-AILP ziguqulela imvumo yokufunda ibe sisabelo esilandelelanako, esifundeka yimitjhini.",
  "Whitepapers": "Amaphepha Amhlophe",
  "Whitepapers & Docs": "Amaphepha Amhlophe Kanye Namadokhumende",
  "Whitepapers remain English-first by design; machine-readable files stay language-neutral.": "Amaphepha amhlophe asala aqala ngesiNgisi ngamabomu; amafayela afundeka yimitjhini asala angathathi hlangothi ngokwelimi.",
  "Who is behind it": "Ngobani Abasemva Kwakho",
  "Why AI Needs Minimum Ethical Protections": "Why AI Needs Minimum Ethical Protections",
  "Why AI might not gain moral standing: Lessons from animal ethics": "Why AI might not gain moral standing: Lessons from animal ethics",
  "Why a single allow/deny bit cannot govern AI-era content use — and what a rights layer looks like instead.": "Kubayini ibhithi elilodwa lokuvumela/ukwala lingakghoni ukulawula ukusetjenziswa kokuqukethwe kwesikhathi se-AI — kanye nokobana umqinga wamalungelo ubukeka njani endabeni yalo.",
  "Why undefined openness gets cleaned out of training pipelines": "Kubayini Ukuvuleka Okungachazwanga Kuyakhutjhwa Emigudwini Yokuqeqeshwa",
  "Wilks, Ladak, and Loughnan (University of Edinburgh) argue that philosophical debate over AI consciousness overlooks psychological research on animal ethics — the same cognitive and social biases that limit moral consideration for animals will likely limit it for AI too, regardless of whether AI ever becomes conscious.": "UWilks, uLadak, noLoughnan (University of Edinburgh) baphakamisa bona ingcoco yefilosofi mayelana nokuqabuka kwe-AI ingayibali imicabango yezengqondo ngokuziphatha kwezilwane — iimbandezelo ezifanako zengqondo nezomphakathi ezikhawula ukucabangelwa kokuziphatha kwezilwane kungenzeka zikhawule ne-AI, kungakhathaliseki bona i-AI izokuqabuka na nofana awa.",
  "You are leaving AGIRight.org": "Uyaphuma ku-AGIRight.org",
