  "“AICL: AI Ingestion & Capability Layer” now published in English as the canonical edition; the Chinese original manuscript remains available and both versions cross-link.": "I-“AICL: AI Ingestion & Capability Layer” khathesi ipapashwe ngesiNgisi njengohlelo olusemthethweni; umtlolo wokuthoma wesiTjhayina uyasala utholakala begodu iinguqulo zombili ziyaxhumana.",
  "“Protocolized Openness” confirmed as an English-language paper (with Chinese parallel passages) — no separate translation planned.": "I-“Protocolized Openness” isiqinisekisiwe njengephepha ngelimi lesiNgisi (ngeengcenye zesiTjhayina eziqhubekako eceleni) — akukho ihunyutjho elihlukileko elicwayilelweko.",
